Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F,$888,$F88,$8F8,$88F
For I=0 To 40 : Ink I mod 12 : Box I*3,I*2 To 300-I*2,190-I : Next I
Ink 2 : Bar 50,50 To 90,80 : Ink 5 : Text 60,120,"PACKED"
Pack 0 To 12,16,8,120,90 : Print #1,Length(12)>0
Spack 0 To 13,8,4,200,100 : Print #1,Length(13)>0
Cls 0 : Unpack 12 : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact2_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Unpack 12,40,30 : Unpack 12,203,100 : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact2_2.iff"
Unpack 12,300,0
Unpack 12,0,180
Unpack 13 To 2 : Print #1,Screen Width;Screen Height;Screen Colour;Screen
Print #1,X Screen(0);Y Hard(0)
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact2_3.iff"
Screen Open 1,320,200,4,Lowres : Curs Off : Cls 0
Unpack 12,0,0
Screen Close 1
Screen 0 : Double Buffer : Autoback 1 : Cls 0
Unpack 12,24,16 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact2_4.iff"
Autoback 0 : Unpack 13,64,64 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact2_5.iff"
Reserve As Work 14,100 : Unpack 14,0,0
Unpack 14 To 3
Print #1,"end"
